### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TeddyPups API – REST Client requests
### Install "REST Client" VS Code extension to run these.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@teddypups.com
@adminPassword = Admin@123

### ===========================
### HEALTH
### ===========================

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – SETTINGS
### ===========================

### Get site settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – PUPPIES
### ===========================

### List available puppies (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies

### Filter by breed
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies?breed=maltipoo

### Filter by origin
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies?origin=imported

### Filter by gender
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies?gender=girl

### Featured puppies
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies?featured=true

### Paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies?page=1&limit=5

### Gone-home puppies
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies/gone-home

### Get puppy by slug (with prev/next)
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies/max-maltipoo-boy

### 404 for unknown slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/puppies/does-not-exist

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – HAPPY FAMILIES
### ===========================

### List happy families (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/happy-families?page=1&limit=6

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – TESTIMONIALS
### ===========================

### All testimonials
GET {{baseUrl}}/testimonials

### Featured only
GET {{baseUrl}}/testimonials?featured=true

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – FAQS
### ===========================

### All FAQs
GET {{baseUrl}}/faqs

### Home-page FAQs only
GET {{baseUrl}}/faqs?home=true

### ===========================
### PUBLIC – ENQUIRIES
### ===========================

### Submit contact enquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/../api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "+971 50 123 4567",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "area": "Dubai Marina",
  "message": "I am interested in a Maltipoo puppy.",
  "source": "contact"
}

### Submit puppy enquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/../api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "phone": "+971 55 987 6543",
  "source": "puppy",
  "puppySlug": "max-maltipoo-boy",
  "message": "Is Max still available?"
}

### Honeypot test (bot trap – should return fake 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/../api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bot Test",
  "phone": "+971 50 000 0000",
  "source": "contact",
  "website": "http://spam.example.com"
}

### Validation failure test
POST {{baseUrl}}/../api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "phone": "12",
  "source": "invalid"
}

### ===========================
### AUTH
### ===========================

### Login
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ── After login, copy the token from the response ──
### Paste it below (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get current admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – STATS
### ===========================

### Dashboard stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – PUPPIES
### ===========================

### List all puppies (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search puppies
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies?q=Maltipoo&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies?status=gone-home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create puppy
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test Puppy",
  "breed": "Maltipoo",
  "breedGroups": ["maltipoo"],
  "gender": "boy",
  "ageLabel": "2 months",
  "origin": "local",
  "description": "A test puppy entry.",
  "images": [{ "url": "/uploads/puppies/puppy-1-1.svg", "alt": "test" }]
}

### Get puppy by ID (replace ID)
@puppyId = REPLACE_WITH_PUPPY_ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/{{puppyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update puppy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/{{puppyId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ageLabel": "3 months"
}

### Change puppy status to gone-home
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/{{puppyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "gone-home"
}

### Change puppy status back to available
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/{{puppyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "available"
}

### Reorder puppies
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": [
    { "id": "REPLACE_ID_1", "sortOrder": 1 },
    { "id": "REPLACE_ID_2", "sortOrder": 2 }
  ]
}

### Delete puppy
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/puppies/{{puppyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – ENQUIRIES
### ===========================

### List enquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter enquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries?status=new&source=contact
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search enquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries?q=John
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single enquiry (replace ID)
@enquiryId = REPLACE_WITH_ENQUIRY_ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries/{{enquiryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update enquiry status + note
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries/{{enquiryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "contacted",
  "adminNote": "Called back, will visit showroom tomorrow."
}

### Export enquiries CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries/export.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete enquiry
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/enquiries/{{enquiryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – HAPPY FAMILIES
### ===========================

### List happy families
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/happy-families
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create happy family
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/happy-families
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "imageUrl": "/uploads/families/family-1.svg",
  "alt": "Happy family with puppy",
  "caption": "Test caption",
  "sortOrder": 99
}

### Update happy family (replace ID)
@familyId = REPLACE_WITH_FAMILY_ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/happy-families/{{familyId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "caption": "Updated caption"
}

### Delete happy family
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/happy-families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – FAQS
### ===========================

### List FAQs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create FAQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "Test question?",
  "answer": "Test answer.",
  "showOnHome": false,
  "sortOrder": 99
}

### Update FAQ (replace ID)
@faqId = REPLACE_WITH_FAQ_ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/{{faqId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "answer": "Updated answer."
}

### Delete FAQ
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/{{faqId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – TESTIMONIALS
### ===========================

### List testimonials
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/testimonials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create testimonial
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/testimonials
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "location": "Abu Dhabi, UAE",
  "quote": "Amazing experience!",
  "featured": false,
  "sortOrder": 99
}

### Update testimonial (replace ID)
@testimonialId = REPLACE_WITH_TESTIMONIAL_ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/testimonials/{{testimonialId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quote": "Updated quote."
}

### Delete testimonial
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/testimonials/{{testimonialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – SETTINGS
### ===========================

### Get settings (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update settings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tagline": "Updated tagline for TeddyPups",
  "happyMomentsCount": 300
}

### ===========================
### ADMIN – UPLOADS
### ===========================

### Upload images (use form-data; in REST Client this is limited)
### For images, test with Postman or curl:
### curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/upload/images \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
###   -F "images=@/path/to/photo.jpg"

### Upload video (test with Postman or curl):
### curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/upload/video \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
###   -F "video=@/path/to/video.mp4"
